    "body": "## Problem\n\nLSP servers can register identical file watchers before removing old registrations. Each registration creates another watcher tree, making setup and teardown expensive in large workspaces.\n\n## Solution\n\nMove glob compilation into `vim._watch` and accept rules for multiple roots alongside existing single-path and LPeg inputs. Share compatible backends until their last subscription is cancelled.\n\nReplaces #41755.\n\nRef: #23291\n\nAI-assisted\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-24T19:36:56Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
